## Interface: 11200
## Title: |cffffffffUnreal|cfff5ae0a Quest
## Notes: Quest helper for the Unreal Azeroth client. A movable quest tracker and service-NPC selector, current-zone world-map pins, minimap pins, quest tracking and entity tooltips. The main quest + HUD waypoint layer ships disabled - see docs/HUD-WAYPOINT.md.
